WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
The general at Yanmen Pass

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,680
Recruiting officer under the battle, surnamed Zhao

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,920
I heard you killed Menghut, come and see.

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,120
General of Yanmen Pass

5
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:13,790
He is the biggest official of this generation. Are young people interested?

6
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,830
Become a former soldier under the general's command

7
00:00:15,830 --> 00:00:18,220
Can you tolerate me for two months?

8
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,820
I want to settle down at home

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,940
It would be better if you serve the adults wholeheartedly

10
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:25,880
After those two months, I’ll come back for another two months

11
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,360
Enough for me to break through

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,700
This is the first hero

13
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:42,320
When Chen Pokong comes with me, you will live here.

14
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,600
Get to know the brothers

15
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:49,400
Training starts tomorrow for the new Chen Polong. Please take care of me.

16
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:53,220
tiger fighting hero

17
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,700
I heard you are alone

18
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,100
Killed a tiger with a smile

19
00:00:57,460 --> 00:00:59,660
Fighting a tiger is different from fighting a war

20
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:01,340
Show your brothers what you are capable of

21
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:05,590
Seven consecutive kills with the first knife in a row

22
00:01:06,230 --> 00:01:08,910
Where did you learn this sword technique? Teach us Chen Poxiong

23
00:01:09,030 --> 00:01:10,030
Zhou Tong will teach you how to get there

24
00:01:11,050 --> 00:01:12,930
I heard about the stabbing yesterday

25
00:01:13,370 --> 00:01:14,370
Your sword skills

26
00:01:14,730 --> 00:01:16,010
Schooled in Jianghu

27
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:19,100
Good knife skills but

28
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:20,940
You know Jianghu Bosha

29
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:22,060
fighting on the battlefield

30
00:01:22,260 --> 00:01:24,780
What's the difference? On the battlefield you're facing

31
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:26,060
hundreds of enemies

32
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:29,600
There's no time for you to play tricks with your knife

33
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,760
Killing is okay

34
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,120
If we go to the battlefield

35
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,440
Make up half an hour

36
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:34,760
You will be stabbed into a sieve
